# Blog admin (/admin).
#
# Secrets — set on the deployment (wrangler secret put / dashboard "Secret"),
# or in .dev.vars for local preview. Never commit real values.
#
# ADMIN_PASSWORD        The password for /admin. Required.
# GITHUB_TOKEN          Fine-grained PAT from the repo owner's account, this
#                       repository only, Contents: Read and write. Required.
# ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET  Optional. Signs the session cookie; defaults to the
#                       password, so changing the password signs everyone out.
#
# Non-secret settings — already set in wrangler.jsonc under "vars". Only needed
# here when running outside the Worker (e.g. plain `next dev`).
#
# GITHUB_REPO           owner/repo to commit to.
# GITHUB_BRANCH         Branch to commit to. Defaults to main.

ADMIN_PASSWORD=
GITHUB_TOKEN=
ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET=
GITHUB_REPO=SublimePlus/Sublime-landing-page
GITHUB_BRANCH=main
